class="site-page" href="/archives/"><i class="fa-fw fas fa-archive"></i><span> 时间轴</span></a></div></div><div id="toggle-menu"><span class="site-page"><i class="fas fa-bars fa-fw"></i></span></div></div></nav><div id="post-info"><h1 class="post-title">RCE</h1><div id="post-meta"><div class="meta-firstline"><span class="post-meta-date"><i class="far fa-calendar-alt fa-fw post-meta-icon"></i><span class="post-meta-label">发表于</span><time class="post-meta-date-created" datetime="2025-02-20T14:52:31.000Z" title="发表于 2025-02-20 22:52:31">2025-02-20</time><span class="post-meta-separator">|</span><i class="fas fa-history fa-fw post-meta-icon"></i><span class="post-meta-label">更新于</span><time class="post-meta-date-updated" datetime="2025-04-23T02:19:40.643Z" title="更新于 2025-04-23 10:19:40">2025-04-23</time></span></div><div class="meta-secondline"><span class="post-meta-separator">|</span><span class="post-meta-pv-cv" id="" data-flag-title=""><i class="far fa-eye fa-fw post-meta-icon"></i><span class="post-meta-label">浏览量:</span><span id="busuanzi_value_page_pv"><i class="fa-solid fa-spinner fa-spin"></i></span></span></div></div></div></header><main class="layout" id="content-inner"><div id="post"><article class="container post-content" id="article-container"><h1 id="RCE"><a href="#RCE" class="headerlink" title="RCE"></a>RCE</h1><p><strong>原理：</strong></p>
<p>攻击者能够通过漏洞在<strong>远程服务器或设备上执行任意代码</strong>的严重安全缺陷。其本质是应用程序未对用户输入进行有效过滤，导致攻击者可通过注入恶意代码或命令，直接控制目标系统。</p>
<p><strong>核心机制：</strong></p>
<ul>
<li><p>用户输入直接凭借至命令或代码：应用程序将未经验证的用户输入拼接到系统命令、数据库查询、反序列化操作或动态代码执行函数中。</p>
<figure class="highlight php"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br><span class="line">3</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><span class="line"><span class="comment">// PHP示例：直接拼接用户输入执行系统命令</span></span><br><span class="line"><span class="variable">$cmd</span> = <span class="string">&quot;ping &quot;</span> . <span class="variable">$_GET</span>[<span class="string">&#x27;ip&#x27;</span>];</span><br><span class="line"><span class="title function_ invoke__">system</span>(<span class="variable">$cmd</span>);</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure>
</li>
<li><p>反序列化漏洞：反序列化不可信数据时触发恶意代码（如java的<code>readObject()</code>、Python的<code>pickle</code>模块）</p>
</li>
<li><p>文件上传漏洞：上传恶意文件（如<code>Web Shell</code>）并通过Web服务器解析执行</p>
</li>
</ul>
<p><strong>常见场景：</strong></p>
<ul>
<li>系统命令执行函数（如<code>exec</code>、<code>system</code>、<code>popen</code>）</li>
<li>动态代码执行函数（如<code>eval</code>、<code>assert</code>）</li>
<li>模板引擎解析（如<code>jinja2</code>、<code>Freemarker</code>）</li>
<li>反序列化操作（如<code>JSON</code>、<code>XML</code>、<code>YAML</code>解析）</li>
</ul>
<h1 id="RCE利用"><a href="#RCE利用" class="headerlink" title="RCE利用"></a>RCE利用</h1><p><strong>攻击方式：</strong></p>
<ul>
<li><p>命令注入：通过输入注入系统命令分隔符（如<code>;</code>、<code>&amp;&amp;</code>、<code>|</code>）</p>
<figure class="highlight bash"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><span class="line"><span class="comment"># 攻击载荷：拼接命令执行</span></span><br><span class="line">user_input=127.0.0.1; <span class="built_in">cat</span> /etc/passwd</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure>
</li>
<li><p>代码注入：在动态语言中利用<code>eval</code>执行恶意代码</p>
<figure class="highlight python"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><span class="line">user_input = <span class="string">&quot;__import__(&#x27;os&#x27;).system(&#x27;rm -rf /&#x27;)&quot;</span></span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure>
</li>
<li><p>反序列化攻击：构造恶意序列化数据触发代码执行</p>
<figure class="highlight java"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><span class="line">ObjectInputStream.readObject() → InvokerTransformer.transform()</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure>
</li>
<li><p>Web Shell上传：上传包含恶意代码的文件（如PHP的<code>&lt;?php system($_GET[&#39;cmd&#39;]);?&gt;</code>）</p>
</li>
</ul>
<p><strong>无回显技巧：</strong></p>
<ul>
<li>bash反弹shell</li>
<li>DNS带外数据</li>
<li>利用<code>sleep</code>或其他逻辑构造布尔条件</li>
<li>文件写入到可访问地方</li>
</ul>
<h1 id="RCE防御"><a href="#RCE防御" class="headerlink" title="RCE防御"></a>RCE防御</h1><p><strong>输入验证与净化：</strong></p>
<ul>
<li>白名单过滤：仅允许预期字符（如数字、字母）</li>
<li>转义危险字符(<code>&amp;</code>、<code>|</code>、<code>$</code>转义为&amp;amp;等)</li>
</ul>
<p><strong>避免危险函数：</strong></p>
<ul>
<li>禁用<code>eval</code>、<code>system</code>等高风险函数，改用安全的API<figure class="highlight php"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br><span class="line">3</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><span class="line"><span class="comment">// 安全替代方案：使用参数化执行</span></span><br><span class="line"><span class="variable">$cmd</span> = [<span class="string">&#x27;ping&#x27;</span>, <span class="variable">$_GET</span>[<span class="string">&#x27;ip&#x27;</span>]];</span><br><span class="line"><span class="title function_ invoke__">shell_exec</span>(<span class="variable">$cmd</span>);</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure></li>
</ul>
<p><strong>权限最小化：</strong></p>
<ul>
<li>应用程序运行在低权限账户下，限制其对系统资源的访问</li>
</ul>
<p><strong>反序列化防护:</strong></p>
<ul>
<li>避免反序列化不可信数据，使用安全的序列化库（如<code>JSON</code>而非<code>java</code>原生序列化）</li>
</ul>
<p><strong>文件上传限制：</strong></p>
<ul>
<li>校验文件类型、内容、扩展名，存储上传文件到非Web目录</li>
</ul>
<p><strong>安全编码实践：</strong></p>
<ul>
<li>使用参数化查询、预编译语句（防御SQL注入间接导致RCE）</li>
<li>启用Web应用防火墙（WAF）检测恶意载荷</li>
</ul>
<h1 id="RCE绕过"><a href="#RCE绕过" class="headerlink" title="RCE绕过"></a>RCE绕过</h1><p><strong>命令注入绕过:</strong></p>
<ul>
<li><p>编码与拼接：使用Base64编码命令或环境变量拼接</p>
<figure class="highlight bash"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><span class="line"><span class="comment"># 绕过过滤&quot;cat /etc/passwd&quot;</span></span><br><span class="line">user_input=127.0.0.1; <span class="built_in">echo</span> <span class="string">&#x27;Y2F0IC9ldGMvcGFzc3dk&#x27;</span> | <span class="built_in">base64</span> -d | bash</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure>
</li>
<li><p>通配符利用：通过<code>*</code>、<code>？</code>等通配符绕过黑名单</p>
<figure class="highlight bash"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><span class="line"><span class="comment"># 执行/bin/cat</span></span><br><span class="line">user_input=127.0.0.1; /???/c?t /etc/passwd</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure></li>
</ul>
<p><strong>代码注入绕过：</strong></p>
<ul>
<li>字符串拼接与编码：拆分关键字或使用十六进制编码<figure class="highlight python"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><span class="line"><span class="comment"># 绕过&quot;os.system&quot;过滤</span></span><br><span class="line">user_input = <span class="string">&quot;__import__(&#x27;o&#x27;+&#x27;s&#x27;).system(&#x27;id&#x27;)&quot;</span></span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure></li>
</ul>
<p><strong>反序列化绕过：</strong></p>
<ul>
<li>利用不同链（Gadget Chains）：当常见链被防御时，寻找其他类库或框架中的利用链。</li>
</ul>
<p><strong>WAF绕过:</strong></p>
<ul>
<li><p>混淆攻击载荷：使用注释、空白符、多行分隔符混淆代码</p>
